<custom_item>
  type            : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description     : "1.0011 - MSSRV - Deny log on locally to include Guests"
  info            : "This security setting determines which users are prevented from logging on at the computer."
  solution        : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to include Guests :"
